        "Accounting and tax advice built around how you actually earn.",
        "Harrison James works with small and medium businesses, contractors, landlords and high-earning individuals across the UK. Fixed monthly fees, a named accountant, and proactive advice — not just a tax return once a year.",
        "Request a callback",
        "Tell us a little about you and we'll match you with the right accountant, usually within one working day.",
        "No obligation. We reply within one business day.",
        "UK Chartered Accountants",
        "Trading in the UK",
        "Average client rating"
      ]
    },
