      "text": [
        "Specialist accounting for four kinds of client",
        "We don't try to be everything to everyone. Each of our teams is set up around the specific tax rules, deadlines and pressures of one type of client.",
        "SMEs & Owner-Managed Businesses",
        "Statutory accounts, Corporation Tax, VAT and Making Tax Digital handled end to end, plus monthly management accounts so you know your numbers, not just your bank balance.",
        "Contractors & Freelancers",
        "Limited company or umbrella, we set you up correctly from day one, run IR35 status reviews, and handle Self Assessment, dividends and VAT so you get paid with confidence.",
        "Landlords & Property Investors",
        "From a single buy-to-let to a portfolio held in an SPV, we manage rental accounts, mortgage interest restrictions, Capital Gains Tax on disposals and incorporation advice.",
        "High-Earning Individuals",
        "Personal tax planning for those earning above £100,000, including pension annual allowance, the High Income Child Benefit Charge, and structuring income between salary, dividends and capital.",
        "What we do"
      ]
    },
