        "\"They restructured my portfolio into an SPV and walked me through every tax implication in plain English. My CGT bill on the last sale was thousands lower than I expected.\"",
        "\"As a contractor I was terrified of getting IR35 wrong. Harrison James reviewed my contract before I signed and gave me a written status assessment. Total peace of mind.\"",
